<template><div class="page"><el-alert title="安全审计日志仅展示当前用户的数据；TOTP、恢复码、设备管理和异常 IP 提醒已预留扩展位。" type="info" show-icon :closable="false"/><el-card><template #header><div class="header"><div><b>安全审计</b><small>登录、密码、令牌、通知、导出删除与备份等关键操作</small></div><div><el-select v-model="operation" clearable placeholder="操作"><el-option v-for="x in operations" :key="x" :value="x"/></el-select><el-select v-model="result" clearable placeholder="结果"><el-option label="成功" value="SUCCESS"/><el-option label="失败" value="FAILED"/></el-select><el-button @click="load">刷新</el-button></div></div></template><div class="desktop"><el-table :data="logs"><el-table-column prop="operation" label="操作"/><el-table-column label="资源"><template #default="{row}">{{row.resourceType||'-'}} #{{row.resourceId||'-'}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="result" label="结果" width="90"><template #default="{row}"><el-tag :type="row.result==='SUCCESS'?'success':'danger'">{{row.result==='SUCCESS'?'成功':'失败'}}</el-tag></template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="ipAddress" label="IP"/><el-table-column prop="userAgent" label="User-Agent" show-overflow-tooltip/><el-table-column prop="failureReason" label="失败原因" show-overflow-tooltip/><el-table-column prop="occurredAt" label="时间" width="180"/></el-table></div><div class="mobile"><article v-for="x in logs" :key="x.id"><div><b>{{x.operation}}</b><el-tag :type="x.result==='SUCCESS'?'success':'danger'" size="small">{{x.result}}</el-tag></div><p>{{x.resourceType||'ACCOUNT'}} #{{x.resourceId||'-'}}</p><small>{{x.occurredAt}} · {{x.ipAddress||'未知 IP'}}</small><em v-if="x.failureReason">{{x.failureReason}}</em></article></div><el-empty v-if="!logs.length" description="暂无审计记录"/></el-card></div></template>
<script setup lang="ts">import{onMounted,ref,watch}from'vue';import{listAuditLogs,type AuditLog}from'@/api/security';const logs=ref<AuditLog[]>([]),operation=ref(''),result=ref('');const operations=['LOGIN','LOGOUT','CHANGE_PASSWORD','PAT_CREATE','PAT_REVOKE','CHANNEL_CHANGE','DATA_EXPORT','DATA_DELETE','BACKUP','VERIFY_BACKUP'];async function load(){logs.value=(await listAuditLogs(operation.value,result.value)).data;}watch([operation,result],load);onMounted(load);</script>
<style scoped>.page{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}.header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.header>div{display:flex;gap:8px}.header small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#718096}.mobile{display:none}@media(max-width:768px){.header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.header>div:last-child{display:grid;width:100%;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.desktop{display:none}.mobile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}.mobile article{padding:14px;border:1px solid #e5eaf1;border-radius:12px}.mobile article>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mobile p,.mobile small,.mobile em{display:block;margin:7px 0;color:#718096}.mobile em{color:#d44;font-style:normal}}</style>
